=\"background-color:transparent\">(),</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">optio<u></u>ns</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">list</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">width</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">1000</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> height</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">270</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">,</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> col</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">=</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:rgb(128,0,0)\">&#39;blue&#39;</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">))</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\noutput$view2 </span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"> renderGvis</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">({</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\ngvisScatterChart</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">(</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">datasetInput2</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\"><u></u>())</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">\r\n\r\n</span><span style=\"background-color:transparent\">})</span></code></pre></div></blockquote></div></div></div></blockquote></div></div></div>"
